3,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The current state of the break room is inefficient. We need a formal purpose to stop the chaos from bleeding into our workspace.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It feels like we're just guessing how to use it. Maybe we should see what's actually happening there.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"It's like a wild jungle! But someone always has to clean up the mess, and that's not fair. We need a real plan!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, everyone. While the room is chaotic, let us remember that the space between us is where our true connection grows. We need a place for honest talk.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"A plan is necessary. However, we should first identify the hidden costs of the current arrangement before deciding on a new one.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, logic dictates we look at the physical disturbances first. The noise and the mess are the primary issues affecting our productivity.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, if we could... maybe look at the money side too? I'm worried about what we're paying for things we can't do in that room.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,Yes! And who is actually using it? I bet some people just take over the whole place and leave the crumbs for others!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is wise to look at the patterns of our lives. Let us see how we have been spending our time and where our conversations have gone.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with looking at usage, but I am specifically interested in the labor involved. We need to know where the hours are actually going.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll focus on the sound and the hygiene. If we can prove the room is a nuisance, the solution becomes obvious.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'd like to see the invoices. And maybe the quotes for the fit-outs, just so we know the actual cost.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to see the crumbs and the bins! And I want to know who is in there the most. No more guessing!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the unplanned talks and the locations of our awkward moments. The heart of the matter is often found in the silence.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will investigate the outside hire invoices and the facilities callouts. I want to see the maintenance burden on this floor.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,Fine. Let's gather the data and meet back here. I expect a logical conclusion once the facts are presented.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,This is like a detective game! I'm ready!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May we find not just data, but a way to bring us closer together.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let us proceed with the investigation.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
